{"seq":3,"slug":"hotspot-isolation","title":"热点商品与热点接口隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/traffic-shaping-gateway/hotspot-isolation","wordCount":3749,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"热点商品与热点接口隔离\">热点商品与热点接口隔离</h1><p>秒杀流量在统计上是极度偏斜的：一场大促里，前十个爆款商品可能吃掉全站 80% 的请求量，而某个主推款的请求量又是其余九个之和。这个分布对全局限流是个灾难——全站限流每秒十万次时，爆款独自吃掉九万次，剩下一万次由几万个长尾商品分享，长尾实际上不可用。更糟的是，爆款的请求集中冲击同一个 Redis key、同一行数据库记录、同一台缓存节点的同一个分片，把这个「点」打穿，而它的物理位置不会因为加了全局限流而改变。热点隔离要解决的就是这个问题：<strong>让一个点的拥堵不蔓延成整站的事故</strong>——识别热点、给热点分配独立配额、限制热点在物理资源上的影响范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-热点的识别与静态-动态两条路径\">核心概念：热点的识别与静态、动态两条路径</h2><h3 id=\"静态登记与它的失效\">静态登记与它的失效</h3><p>最直接的做法是运营在后台配置「本次活动的热点商品列表」。秒杀场景下这通常已经够用——大促的主推款是提前确定的。静态登记的优点是零成本、零误判。它的失效模式有三个。第一，<strong>漏记</strong>：某个原本不在名单里的商品因为社交媒体传播突然爆火，系统对此毫无准备。第二，<strong>名单过时</strong>：活动开始后运营临时换款，但缓存与配额配置没有同步更新。第三，<strong>次生热点</strong>：秒杀商品本身被隔离了，但它的详情页调用的公共接口（比如「店铺评分」「库存查询」）成了新的热点，QPS 与商品本身一样高，却不在任何名单上。第三点尤其危险，因为它把一个「数量问题」变成了「依赖问题」：隔离了商品，但没隔离商品依赖的公共资源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"热点登记表与广播协议\">热点登记表与广播协议</h3><p>静态名单与动态检测结果写进同一张登记表，配额层与路由层只读它：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE hotspot_registry (&#10;  activity_id   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  resource_type TEXT        NOT NULL CHECK (resource_type IN (&#39;sku&#39;, &#39;api_path&#39;)),&#10;  resource_key  TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  source        TEXT        NOT NULL CHECK (source IN (&#39;manual&#39;, &#39;detected&#39;)),&#10;  quota_layer   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  detected_at   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  expires_at    TIMESTAMPTZ,          -- 动态热点自动过期；手工登记为 NULL&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (activity_id, resource_type, resource_key)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hotspot_registry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activity_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resource_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (resource_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sku'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api_path'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resource_key  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'manual'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'detected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_layer   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detected_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 动态热点自动过期；手工登记为 NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (activity_id, resource_type, resource_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><code>source</code> 区分来源，<code>expires_at</code> 让检测出的热点自动失效，避免「昨天的爆款今天还被小配额限制」</li>\n<li>主键按 <code>(activity_id, resource_type, resource_key)</code> 组织，重复登记天然幂等，是覆盖而非追加</li>\n</ul>\n<p>登记表每次变更通过一条带版本号的广播消息推给全部网关实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;hotspot_update&quot;,&#10;  &quot;activity_id&quot;: &quot;act_20261111&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: 42,&#10;  &quot;added&quot;: [{ &quot;resource_type&quot;: &quot;sku&quot;, &quot;resource_key&quot;: &quot;sku_9001&quot;, &quot;quota_layer&quot;: &quot;hot_sku&quot;, &quot;ttl_seconds&quot;: 120 }],&#10;  &quot;removed&quot;: [{ &quot;resource_type&quot;: &quot;sku&quot;, &quot;resource_key&quot;: &quot;sku_9002&quot; }]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hotspot_update\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"activity_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"act_20261111\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"added\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resource_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resource_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku_9001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"quota_layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hot_sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ttl_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"removed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resource_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resource_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku_9002\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>接收侧按固定顺序校验，任一步失败即丢弃该消息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>返回码</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>STALE_VERSION</code></td>\n<td>消息版本号 ≤ 本地版本</td>\n<td>丢弃，不告警（正常乱序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UNKNOWN_ACTIVITY</code></td>\n<td>活动不在本地活动表</td>\n<td>丢弃并告警（配置漂移）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>APPLIED</code></td>\n<td>版本号更新且活动匹配</td>\n<td>更新本地热点表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PARTIAL_APPLIED</code></td>\n<td>部分 key 更新失败</td>\n<td>回滚并全量重拉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><code>version</code> 必须单调递增：没有版本判断时，一条延迟的旧消息会把刚撤销的热点重新加回，或把刚加上的热点抹掉</li>\n<li><code>ttl_seconds</code> 由发送方决定而非接收方，保证所有实例对同一热点的过期时刻判断一致</li>\n<li>版本号与热点表必须同一次原子写入，否则推进版本号而表未更新会让后续消息被永久判为 <code>STALE_VERSION</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"动态热点的检测\">动态热点的检测</h3><p>动态检测的思路是统计每个资源 key 在短时间窗内的访问次数，超过阈值即判定为热点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>hot</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(k) = \\frac{C_k(t-\\Delta,\\ t)}{\\Delta} &gt; \\theta_{\\text{hot}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 key <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 在窗口内的访问计数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>hot</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{hot}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是判定阈值。实现有两种取向：<strong>本地统计 + 定期聚合</strong>——每个实例用 Count-Min Sketch 或滑动窗口统计本地 key 频率，每隔几秒上报 top-N 后聚合，零额外网络开销，但有秒级滞后；<strong>集中统计</strong>——所有 key 打点送到中心计数器（Redis <code>INCR</code> 或本地内存 + 定期合并），即时但计数器本身成为热点与单点。工程上通常用第一种：热点危害是持续的（打爆分片一整个活动周期），几秒延迟可接受，单点风险不可接受。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n<th>检测延迟</th>\n<th>额外网络开销</th>\n<th>单点风险</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态登记</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>确定的主推款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地统计+聚合</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>低（周期上报）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>默认方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集中计数</td>\n<td>近实时</td>\n<td>每请求一次</td>\n<td>高（中心单点）</td>\n<td>需要秒级发现的场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[请求进入] --&gt; B[提取资源 key&lt;br/&gt;sku_id / api_path]&#10;  B --&gt; C[本地滑动窗口计数]&#10;  C --&gt; D{本地 top-N?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[写入本地热点表]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[正常路径]&#10;  E --&gt; G[每 N 秒聚合上报]&#10;  G --&gt; H[全局热点名单&lt;br/&gt;广播到所有实例]&#10;  H --&gt; I[下一个窗口按热点处理]\">graph TD\n  A[请求进入] --&gt; B[提取资源 key&lt;br/&gt;sku_id / api_path]\n  B --&gt; C[本地滑动窗口计数]\n  C --&gt; D{本地 top-N?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[写入本地热点表]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[正常路径]\n  E --&gt; G[每 N 秒聚合上报]\n  G --&gt; H[全局热点名单&lt;br/&gt;广播到所有实例]\n  H --&gt; I[下一个窗口按热点处理]</pre><h3 id=\"count-min-sketch-的本地热点探测\">Count-Min Sketch 的本地热点探测</h3><p>Count-Min Sketch 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 个哈希函数、每个对应一行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 个计数桶，插入时把每行的对应桶加一，查询时取所有行的最小值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>C</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>CMS</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{C}_k = \\min_{1 \\le j \\le d} \\text{CMS}[j][h_j(k)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6382em;vertical-align:-0.8882em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CMS</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"d, w = 4, 16384                    # 4 行 × 16384 桶，uint32 常驻约 256 KB&#10;CMS = zeros(d, w); WINDOW = 1 秒&#10;THRESHOLD = HOT_QPS_LOCAL * WINDOW # 本实例单独观测到的触发下限&#10;&#10;function observe(key):&#10;  for j in 0 .. d-1:&#10;    CMS[j][ hash_j(key) % w ] += 1&#10;&#10;function tick():                    # 每 WINDOW 结束时执行&#10;  hits = []&#10;  for key in recently_seen_keys:    # 需旁挂本窗口 key 集合，Sketch 无法枚举内部键&#10;    est = min(CMS[j][ hash_j(key) % w ] for j in 0 .. d-1)&#10;    if est &gt;= THRESHOLD: hits.append({ key, est })&#10;  report_topn(sort_desc(hits)[0 : TOP_N])&#10;  CMS.fill(0)                       # 每窗口重置，统计增量而非累计\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>d, w = 4, 16384                    # 4 行 × 16384 桶，uint32 常驻约 256 KB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMS = zeros(d, w); WINDOW = 1 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>THRESHOLD = HOT_QPS_LOCAL * WINDOW # 本实例单独观测到的触发下限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function observe(key):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for j in 0 .. d-1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    CMS[j][ hash_j(key) % w ] += 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function tick():                    # 每 WINDOW 结束时执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  hits = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for key in recently_seen_keys:    # 需旁挂本窗口 key 集合，Sketch 无法枚举内部键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    est = min(CMS[j][ hash_j(key) % w ] for j in 0 .. d-1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if est >= THRESHOLD: hits.append({ key, est })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  report_topn(sort_desc(hits)[0 : TOP_N])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  CMS.fill(0)                       # 每窗口重置，统计增量而非累计</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>它只高估、不低估（哈希碰撞导致计数偏高），因此用它判定热点是安全的：宁可偏高，不要漏判</li>\n<li><strong>每窗口重置</strong>：否则统计的是活动开始至今的累计量，热点永远不会过期</li>\n<li><strong>旁挂窗口内的 key 集合</strong>：Sketch 只能回答「某 key 计数多少」，不能回答「哪些 key 最热」</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 只影响精度与常驻内存（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16384</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=16384</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16384</span></span></span></span></span> 时误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 量级），窗口长度与 top-N 才决定灵敏度与聚合开销</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"配额分层-给热点单独限量\">配额分层：给热点单独限量</h2><p>识别出热点之后，关键动作是<strong>给它一个独立的、更小的配额</strong>，而不是让它在全局配额里自由竞争。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么单独配额比全局配额有效\">为什么单独配额比全局配额有效</h3><p>直觉上，给热点一个更小的配额似乎是「限制它」，实际效果却是「保护它」。理由来自<a href=\"rate-limit-queue-token\">限流、排队与令牌网关</a>：限流速率应匹配下游处理能力。爆款的下游是「单个 Redis key + 单行数据库记录」，处理能力可能只有每秒三千次，而全局限流是每秒十万次。爆款不受单独限制时，十万次全引向那个每秒只能处理三千次的点，通过的请求里 97% 会失败在下一跳——白白消耗网关与前端的资源。给热点一个 3000/秒的独立配额，效果是<strong>在网关层就把注定失败的请求拒掉</strong>，而不是放进去让它们在 Redis 前面排队。这把失败的位置前移了，而越靠前失败，代价越低。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层配额的结构\">分层配额的结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;quota_layers&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;layer&quot;: &quot;global&quot;,&#10;      &quot;limit_per_second&quot;: 100000,&#10;      &quot;applies_to&quot;: &quot;*&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;layer&quot;: &quot;hot_sku&quot;,&#10;      &quot;limit_per_second&quot;: 3000,&#10;      &quot;burst&quot;: 6000,&#10;      &quot;applies_to&quot;: &quot;sku_id IN hotspot_list&quot;,&#10;      &quot;queue&quot;: { &quot;enabled&quot;: true, &quot;timeout_seconds&quot;: 20 }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;layer&quot;: &quot;hot_api&quot;,&#10;      &quot;limit_per_second&quot;: 20000,&#10;      &quot;applies_to&quot;: &quot;/api/stock/query&quot;,&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;商品详情页的公共依赖接口&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;layer&quot;: &quot;cold_default&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reserved_per_second&quot;: 20000,&#10;      &quot;applies_to&quot;: &quot;!hotspot&quot;,&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;预留给长尾商品，防止被热点饿死&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quota_layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"global\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"limit_per_second\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"applies_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hot_sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"limit_per_second\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"burst\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"applies_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku_id IN hotspot_list\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"queue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"timeout_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hot_api\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"limit_per_second\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"applies_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/api/stock/query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"商品详情页的公共依赖接口\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cold_default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reserved_per_second\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"applies_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"!hotspot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"预留给长尾商品，防止被热点饿死\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cold_default</code> 这一层是整个设计里最容易被忽略、却最关键的：<strong>预留配额</strong>。如果所有配额都是「先到先得」，热点会在第一时间吃光全部全局配额，长尾商品无论限流阈值设多高都拿不到份额。预留的做法是把全局配额的一部分<strong>硬性划给非热点流量</strong>，即使热点请求堆积也不让它们越过这条线。它在秒杀场景的价值是保护「不是一个爆款、但也要卖的其他商品」——大促其余 90% 的 GMV。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配额层</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>超限处置</th>\n<th>失效后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>global</td>\n<td>保护整条链路不被总量冲垮</td>\n<td>排队</td>\n<td>下游全面过载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hot_sku</td>\n<td>让热点的失败前移到网关层</td>\n<td>排队（短超时）</td>\n<td>单点打穿，97% 请求在下一跳失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hot_api</td>\n<td>隔离次生热点（公共依赖接口）</td>\n<td>排队 + 降级</td>\n<td>详情页整体不可用，波及非秒杀商品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cold_default</td>\n<td>预留份额，防止长尾被饿死</td>\n<td>拒绝（不占用他人配额）</td>\n<td>其余 90% GMV 归零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个层的超限处置刻意不同：热点层用短超时排队（它的用户愿意等，且等待有价值），长尾层直接拒绝（它的等待没有价值，因为配额本来就少）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配额的动态调整\">配额的动态调整</h3><p>配额不该是静态的：活动开始时热点名单里的商品少（只有主推款），随着活动进行，运营可能临时加码或撤下某个款。配额系统需要支持<strong>运行时更新且不重启</strong>——这是动态配置中心那类基础设施的用武之地。传播延迟直接影响隔离的有效性：配置更新如果需要 5 分钟才推送到所有网关实例，这 5 分钟里被撤下的热点仍享受着独立小配额，被加上的热点仍没有保护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物理隔离-让热点的冲击不落在共享资源上\">物理隔离：让热点的冲击不落在共享资源上</h2><p>配额解决的是「逻辑上给多少」，物理隔离解决的是「这些请求最终打在哪个具体的机器上和 key 上」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分片热点与打散\">分片热点与打散</h3><p>Redis 集群把 key 分布在不同分片上。如果秒杀商品的库存 key 是 <code>stock:{sku_id}</code>，那么某个爆款的所有请求都会路由到同一个分片、同一个节点。该节点的单线程处理能力有限（Redis 单实例 QPS 上限通常在数万到十几万之间，取决于命令复杂度与网络往返），一个爆款就可能把它打满，该分片上的其他 key 跟着一起受影响。打散的常见做法是<strong>库存分片</strong>：把同一个 SKU 的库存拆成 N 份，分别放在 N 个 key 上，比如 <code>stock:{sku_id}:{0..N-1}</code>。扣减时先用 <code>INCR</code> 选一个分片（或哈希到某个分片），再在选中的分片上执行扣减。这带来两个直接收益：单个 key 的写压力降为原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>；分片可以分布在不同节点上，把压力摊到多个物理机器。</p>\n<p>代价是<strong>总量判断变复杂</strong>。单 key 时「剩余库存」就是 <code>GET</code> 一个值；分片后总量是 N 个值之和，而 N 次读取不是原子的，读到的总量可能是一个不一致的快照。因此分片库存下不能用「先读总量再决定是否扣减」，必须用「逐个分片尝试扣减、失败就切换到下一个分片」的逻辑，且每个分片的扣减本身必须是原子的：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- KEYS = N 个分片 key: stock:{sku}:0 ... stock:{sku}:N-1&#10;-- ARGV[1] = qty, ARGV[2] = 随机起点 offset（由调用方注入，不在 Lua 内取）&#10;local n = #KEYS&#10;local qty = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;local start = tonumber(ARGV[2]) % n&#10;for i = 0, n - 1 do&#10;  local idx = (start + i) % n + 1          -- Lua 数组下标从 1 开始&#10;  local avail = tonumber(redis.call(&#39;GET&#39;, KEYS[idx]) or &#39;-1&#39;)&#10;  if avail &gt;= qty then&#10;    redis.call(&#39;DECRBY&#39;, KEYS[idx], qty)&#10;    return {1, &#39;OK&#39;, idx - 1, avail - qty}&#10;  end&#10;end&#10;return {-1, &#39;SOLD_OUT&#39;, -1, 0}             -- 逐个分片都不足，才是真售罄\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS = N 个分片 key: stock:{sku}:0 ... stock:{sku}:N-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[1] = qty, ARGV[2] = 随机起点 offset（由调用方注入，不在 Lua 内取）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local n = #KEYS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local qty = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local start = tonumber(ARGV[2]) % n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for i = 0, n - 1 do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local idx = (start + i) % n + 1          -- Lua 数组下标从 1 开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local avail = tonumber(redis.call('GET', KEYS[idx]) or '-1')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if avail >= qty then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    redis.call('DECRBY', KEYS[idx], qty)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return {1, 'OK', idx - 1, avail - qty}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return {-1, 'SOLD_OUT', -1, 0}             -- 逐个分片都不足，才是真售罄</span></span></code></pre></div><p>起点由调用方在 <code>EVALSHA</code> 参数里注入，而不是在脚本内用 <code>math.random</code>：脚本内取随机数会破坏纯函数性质，且种子可能重复，导致请求总从同一分片开始。返回值带上命中分片下标，便于监控消耗是否严重不均。这个算法的正确性依赖每个分片自身的原子扣减（见 <a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/redis-lua-atomic-deduct\">Redis 原子预扣与 Lua 脚本</a> 里的脚本）。它不保证「尽量让每个分片均衡消耗」——随机起点会导致分片之间的消耗不均，但均匀性在这个场景下不重要，不超卖才是。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分片数与假售罄的取舍\">分片数与假售罄的取舍</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分片数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>单 key 写压力</th>\n<th>假售罄概率</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1（不分片）</td>\n<td>全部压力，单点打穿</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>单分片被爆款打满</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4–8</td>\n<td>降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>总量统计偏差可忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16–64</td>\n<td>降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，可跨节点</td>\n<td>升高（碎片化）</td>\n<td>分片间消耗严重不均，尾部长期剩货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≥128</td>\n<td>继续摊薄</td>\n<td>明显</td>\n<td>key 数量与管理成本失控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「假售罄」指总量其实还有货、只是被尝试到的分片都恰好不足。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 越大该概率越高：库存合计 1000、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 时分片均值仅 15，要买 10 件的请求可能逐个尝试都失败。因此分片数取「够分摊压力」的最小值，而不是越大越好。</p>\n<h3 id=\"机型与部署隔离\">机型与部署隔离</h3><p>除了 key 层面的打散，还有部署层面的隔离：<strong>给热点商品分配独立的服务实例或独立的集群</strong>。大促运维里常见做法是把主推款的路由指向一组专用的、配置更高的实例，其余商品走通用实例池。这样即使专用实例被压满，通用池也不受影响。代价是资源利用率低——专用实例在非活动期间闲置。因此它通常只在确定的主推款上使用，且配合弹性伸缩：活动前半小时扩容专用组，活动后缩容。这与<a href=\"../flash-safety-capacity/capacity-plan-drill\">容量评估与全链路压测演练</a>里的容量模型直接相关——专用组的规格要由压测数据来定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"公共依赖的隔离\">公共依赖的隔离</h3><p>回到前面提到的次生热点问题：秒杀商品详情页依赖的公共接口，比如库存查询、优惠计算、店铺信息。这些接口被热点商品高频调用，本身就成了热点。</p>\n<p><strong>结果缓存</strong>：这些接口的返回在秒杀期间变化极慢（店铺信息几乎不变，库存变化的频率取决于秒杀进度），因此可以加一层短 TTL 的本地缓存。本地缓存把请求从「每次调用下游」变成「每次查本地内存」，这是最彻底的隔离——它根本不产生跨进程流量。代价是缓存不一致的窗口期，对店铺信息完全可以接受，对库存查询则需谨慎（这正是<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/hot-stock-cache-warmup\">热点库存缓存预热</a>要处理的问题）。</p>\n<p><strong>接口降级</strong>：如果某个公共接口在下游不可用时可以安全返回默认值，那就应该在热点压力下主动降级它——比如「近期好评率」返回预计算的静态值而不是实时查询。降级开关必须能在压力下被打开，这一点在<a href=\"../async-order-pipeline/soldout-fast-fail-degrade\">售罄快速失败与降级</a>中有完整的判定与执行设计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离手段</th>\n<th>隔离的维度</th>\n<th>生效速度</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存分片</td>\n<td>单 key 写压力</td>\n<td>部署时</td>\n<td>总量统计复杂、假售罄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专用实例组</td>\n<td>物理资源争抢</td>\n<td>扩容后</td>\n<td>非活动期资源闲置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地短 TTL 缓存</td>\n<td>跨进程调用</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>TTL 内的数据陈旧窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口降级</td>\n<td>下游依赖</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>功能不完整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>秒杀流量高度偏斜，全局限流会让一个爆款吃光配额并打穿它所在的物理分片；隔离的目标是让一个点的拥堵不蔓延成整站事故。</li>\n<li>热点识别可以从静态登记起步，但必须补上动态检测以捕获突发爆款与次生热点（被热点商品高频依赖的公共接口）。</li>\n<li>配额应分层：全局、热点专属、以及最关键的非热点预留配额——预留防止热点把长尾商品饿死。</li>\n<li>物理隔离用库存分片打散单 key 压力，代价是总量判断必须改为逐个分片尝试扣减；部署层面可用专用实例组隔离确定的主推款。</li>\n<li>公共依赖用短 TTL 本地缓存与接口降级隔离，降级开关必须可在压力下被打开。</li>\n<li>参考：Redis 官方文档关于集群分片与单线程执行模型的说明（redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/reference/cluster-spec/）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一章进入库存：热点流量已经被整形与隔离开，现在要处理的是它们共同争抢的那个数值，见<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/hot-stock-cache-warmup\">热点库存缓存预热</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热点商品与热点接口隔离","id":"热点商品与热点接口隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：热点的识别与静态、动态两条路径","id":"核心概念-热点的识别与静态-动态两条路径"},{"level":3,"text":"静态登记与它的失效","id":"静态登记与它的失效"},{"level":3,"text":"热点登记表与广播协议","id":"热点登记表与广播协议"},{"level":3,"text":"动态热点的检测","id":"动态热点的检测"},{"level":3,"text":"Count-Min Sketch 的本地热点探测","id":"count-min-sketch-的本地热点探测"},{"level":2,"text":"配额分层：给热点单独限量","id":"配额分层-给热点单独限量"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么单独配额比全局配额有效","id":"为什么单独配额比全局配额有效"},{"level":3,"text":"分层配额的结构","id":"分层配额的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"配额的动态调整","id":"配额的动态调整"},{"level":2,"text":"物理隔离：让热点的冲击不落在共享资源上","id":"物理隔离-让热点的冲击不落在共享资源上"},{"level":3,"text":"分片热点与打散","id":"分片热点与打散"},{"level":3,"text":"分片数与假售罄的取舍","id":"分片数与假售罄的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"机型与部署隔离","id":"机型与部署隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"公共依赖的隔离","id":"公共依赖的隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"答题验证码与人机校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/traffic-shaping-gateway/captcha-anti-bot"},"next":{"title":"热点库存缓存预热","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/cache-stock-deduct/hot-stock-cache-warmup"}}